- **Composed/decomposed e-acute distinct**: inside the same test, plus
  restated inside `ratios-and-chars-distinct-from-other-classes-on-jvm-
  and-dart`'s own corpus indirectly via distinct string encodings.
- **Ratio fixture encoded or refused, stated per host**: `ratio-fixture`
